<div class="ch-mq mq" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Pushers</span><span>Subdials</span><span>Tachymeter</span><span>Flyback</span><span>Column wheel</span><span>Split-seconds</span><span>Pulsometer</span><span>Pushers</span><span>Subdials</span><span>Tachymeter</span><span>Flyback</span><span>Column wheel</span><span>Split-seconds</span><span>Pulsometer</span></div></div>

<section class="ch-s ch-lt"><div class="ch-w ch-in"><p class="ch-big rv">A chronograph is a stopwatch you wear. Two pushers, three small dials and a scale around the edge turn a wristwatch into an <em>instrument</em>.</p><div class="ch-in-n stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="5">5</b><small>/s</small><span>steps per second on a 4&nbsp;Hz movement</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="30">30</b><small>min</small><span>on a typical minute counter</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="12">12</b><small>h</small><span>on a full hour register</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ch-ar"><div class="ch-w ch-ar-g"><div class="ch-ar-l"><div class="ch-ar-im"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578998323870-83a9a3d609e5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&h=960&q=75" alt="a silver chronograph watch with three subdials" width="760" height="960" loading="lazy"><div class="ch-ar-bar"><i id="ar-bar"></i></div></div></div><div class="ch-ar-r"><p class="ch-ey"><i></i>Anatomy</p><h2 class="rv">Four parts make the measure</h2><div class="ch-ar-s" data-step="0"><span>01</span><h3>The start pusher</h3><p>Press the pusher at two o&rsquo;clock and the central seconds hand leaps into motion, separate from the time of day.</p></div><div class="ch-ar-s" data-step="1"><span>02</span><h3>The subdials</h3><p>Small dials count the elapsed minutes and hours, so one sweep of the big hand becomes a full measured hour.</p></div><div class="ch-ar-s" data-step="2"><span>03</span><h3>The reset pusher</h3><p>Stop with the top pusher, then press the one at four o&rsquo;clock and every chronograph hand snaps back to zero.</p></div><div class="ch-ar-s" data-step="3"><span>04</span><h3>The bezel scale</h3><p>Around the edge, a tachymeter turns elapsed seconds into speed, read directly where the hand stops.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ch-s ch-sw" id="stopwatch"><div class="ch-w"><div class="ch-sw-h"><p class="ch-ey"><i></i>Instrument No. 1</p><h2 class="rv">The stopwatch</h2><p class="ch-p">Press start, then lap or stop. The hands move exactly as a chronograph&rsquo;s would.</p></div><div class="ch-sw-g rv"><div class="ch-sw-d"><svg class="ch-dial ch-dial2" viewBox="0 0 400 400" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="196" class="d-o"/><g class="d-tr"><text transform="rotate(25.2 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">500</text><text transform="rotate(36 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">400</text><text transform="rotate(48 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">300</text><text transform="rotate(60 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">240</text><text transform="rotate(72 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">200</text><text transform="rotate(80 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">180</text><text transform="rotate(96 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">150</text><text transform="rotate(120 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">120</text><text transform="rotate(144 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">100</text><text transform="rotate(160 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">90</text><text transform="rotate(180 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">80</text><text transform="rotate(205.7 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">70</text><text transform="rotate(240 200 200)" x="200" y="16" text-anchor="middle">60</text></g><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="172" class="d-in"/><g class="d-tk"><line x1="200" y1="22" x2="200" y2="36" transform="rotate(0 200 200)" stroke-width="2.4"/><line x1="200" y1="22" x2="200" y2="28" transform="rotate(6 200 200)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="200" y1="22" x2="200" y2="28" transform="rotate(12 200 200)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="200" y1="22" x2="200" y2="28" transform="rotate(18 200 200)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="200" y1="22" x2="200" y2="28" tr